{"id":"aventura","lemma":"aventura","pos":"noun","rank":1421,"glosses":["adventure","affair, fling (an adulterous relationship)"],"ipa":"/abenˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"aventuras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aventura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy listo para la aventura.","en":"I'm ready for the adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823867","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"clever, smart"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Le gustan las aventuras.","en":"He likes adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450170","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"A él le gusta la aventura.","en":"He likes adventure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78157","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La aventura comienza.","en":"The adventure begins.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"}]},{"text":"Él se fue de viaje en busca de aventuras.","en":"He went traveling in search of adventure.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"voyage"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"search"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}